00:19:00.490 --> 00:19:03.220
well, it is a Python program.

00:19:03.220 --> 00:19:09.040
But I've processed it so
for your viewing pleasure.

00:19:09.040 --> 00:19:11.500
OK.

00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:16.530
So let's move on to the
course logistics now.

00:19:19.300 --> 00:19:22.960
Actually, maybe I'll
