00:19:30.470 --> 00:19:31.940
Yeah.

00:19:31.940 --> 00:19:35.540
So would you expect
graduates in this class

00:19:35.540 --> 00:19:37.880
to be able to lead a
team to build a frontier

00:19:37.880 --> 00:19:41.300
model or other
skills [INAUDIBLE]?

00:19:41.300 --> 00:19:43.790
So the question is,
would I expect a graduate

00:19:43.790 --> 00:19:45.770
from this class to be
able to lead a team

00:19:45.770 --> 00:19:47.010
and build a frontier model?

00:19:47.010 --> 00:19:50.310
Of course with $1
billion of capital.

00:19:50.310 --> 00:19:51.860
Yeah, of course.

00:19:51.860 --> 00:19:55.200
I would say that
it's a good step.

00:19:55.200 --> 00:19:59.850
But there's definitely many
pieces that are missing.

00:19:59.850 --> 00:20:02.450
And I think we thought
about we should really

00:20:02.450 --> 00:20:07.460
teach a series of classes that
eventually leads up to as close

00:20:07.460 --> 00:20:08.160
as we can get.

00:20:08.160 --> 00:20:12.447
But I think this is maybe
the first step of the puzzle.

00:20:12.447 --> 00:20:14.030
But there are a lot
of things, and I'm

00:20:14.030 --> 00:20:15.630
happy to talk
offline about that.

00:20:15.630 --> 00:20:16.860
But I like the ambition.

00:20:16.860 --> 00:20:18.200
Yeah.

00:20:18.200 --> 00:20:20.460
That's what you should be
doing, taking the class

00:20:20.460 --> 00:20:23.386
so you can go lead teams
and build frontier models.

00:20:23.386 --> 00:20:23.886
OK.

00:20:27.078 --> 00:20:30.310
OK, let's talk a little
bit about the course.

00:20:30.310 --> 00:20:31.640
So here's a website.

00:20:31.640 --> 00:20:32.780
Everything's online.

00:20:32.780 --> 00:20:36.940
This is a five unit class.

00:20:36.940 --> 00:20:41.140
But I think that maybe it
